Géoplateforme WFS as BD Forêt v2 — no Copernicus Land Monitoring Service
authentication needed. \strong{For studies outside France this route does not
apply}: obtain the data from CLMS and pass the file through \code{file}. That
path is not verified by this package's tests.
}

